01:03:53.770 --> 01:03:57.420
Hey, Buck! Buck, I gotta see you in private.

01:03:57.420 --> 01:03:59.920
- Andy, can't you see we're busy?

01:04:00.000 --> 01:04:02.860
But there's two guys looking for you, and they're packing guns.

01:04:03.200 --> 01:04:04.680
You better run in the house.

01:04:05.060 --> 01:04:05.760
Oh, no.

01:04:06.170 --> 01:04:06.730
Not me.

01:04:07.250 --> 01:04:08.800
I want to meet them out in the open.

01:04:09.000 --> 01:04:12.260
Oh, but, Buck, it's those two outlaws I was telling you about.

01:04:12.680 --> 01:04:13.360
Outlaws, eh?

01:04:13.700 --> 01:04:15.120
Well, I'll be glad to see them.

01:04:15.410 --> 01:04:16.450
Now, you run along, Andy.

01:04:16.630 --> 01:04:17.330
Oh, Buck.

01:04:17.660 --> 01:04:18.250
Run along.

01:04:18.310 --> 01:04:19.030
You're liable to get hurt.

01:04:19.210 --> 01:04:21.030
Oh, I ain't the only one.

01:04:21.590 --> 01:04:23.490
Uh, Joan, you stay here with Andy.

01:04:24.120 --> 01:04:24.880
It'll only take a minute.

01:04:25.230 --> 01:04:26.230
Oh, no.

01:04:32.170 --> 01:04:36.970
we're looking for Benny the owner of this outfit that's me boys make it snappy

01:04:36.970 --> 01:04:46.690
so you're the buzzard that squealed on us to the sheriff I ain't his brother now

01:04:46.690 --> 01:04:53.020
look boys I'm giving you just 10 seconds to get off this property now start moving

01:04:53.020 --> 01:04:57.940
because time's a waste when I say move I mean move

01:05:04.120 --> 01:05:05.740
Dino shooting your varmints.

01:05:08.780 --> 01:05:10.660
We're going to settle this man to man.

01:05:12.110 --> 01:05:14.370
This is where I came in.

01:05:15.010 --> 01:05:17.030
Only the last time I saw it, they gave away a set of dishes.

01:05:19.020 --> 01:05:22.050
Remember our bargain.

01:05:22.350 --> 01:05:23.370
Here's $10 for you.

01:05:24.440 --> 01:05:25.420
Here's your chain.

01:05:33.290 --> 01:05:37.550
No. Are you all right, bud?

01:05:39.480 --> 01:05:47.010
Boys, that was a great act you put on.

01:05:49.380 --> 01:05:51.370
What's she talking about?

01:05:51.690 --> 01:05:54.230
There's no use trying to fool me. I'm in on the whole thing.

01:05:54.630 --> 01:05:56.290
Now, how would you like to work for me?

01:05:56.770 --> 01:05:57.350
Look, lady...

01:05:57.350 --> 01:05:58.710
What's on your mind, ma'am?

01:06:00.000 --> 01:06:02.520
There's going to be a big opening tomorrow night at the B bar M.

01:06:02.660 --> 01:06:02.980
Yeah?

01:06:03.960 --> 01:06:09.440
Suppose the great Buck Benny were held up in front of all those people by a couple of masked bandits.

01:06:11.490 --> 01:06:12.450
Now, let me get this straight.

01:06:13.530 --> 01:06:15.610
You want to pay us for a hold-up?

01:06:15.890 --> 01:06:21.210
Yes, just to prove that Mr. Benny isn't such a hero when somebody else hires the bad man.

01:06:21.870 --> 01:06:23.790
Andy, those guys are too darn rough.

01:06:24.100 --> 01:06:25.540
I want you to fire them right away.

01:06:25.540 --> 01:06:29.320
Fire them? Those are those two outlaws I was telling you about.

01:06:30.350 --> 01:06:31.550
You mean those guys were on the level?

01:06:32.050 --> 01:06:33.850
Those are real bullets in their guns?

01:06:34.330 --> 01:06:36.350
Sure, they're killers, both of them.

01:07:36.940 --> 01:07:39.380
It'll cost a lot, but whales, you get the load of it.

01:15:21.310 --> 01:15:22.310
Well, here I am, Joan.

01:15:22.310 --> 01:15:26.200
Let me tell you something, you're the only one who could get me over to a dress-up place

01:15:26.200 --> 01:15:27.470
like this.

01:15:27.470 --> 01:15:30.000
Too bad I chased you away from this dress-up place.

01:15:31.530 --> 01:15:32.090
What do you mean?

01:15:32.510 --> 01:15:33.590
It's no use, Jack.

01:15:33.880 --> 01:15:37.220
I know all about the act you've been putting on for me at Andy Devine's ranch.

01:15:39.160 --> 01:15:39.440
Oh.

01:15:39.980 --> 01:15:43.020
So, for act two, I went out and hired my own cast.

01:15:43.860 --> 01:15:47.060
I had a fake hold-up all planned for tonight to make you look ridiculous.

01:15:48.970 --> 01:15:50.750
Well, I suppose I had it coming to me.

01:15:51.770 --> 01:15:55.990
Maybe too late to call off the show, so I'm warning you in advance about my bad man.

01:15:57.420 --> 01:16:00.000
Gee, Joan, if you feel that way about me, why are you telling me?

01:16:01.340 --> 01:16:02.600
You know Fred Allen's press agent?

01:16:03.560 --> 01:16:04.790
Yes, I know him. Why?

01:16:06.060 --> 01:16:08.300
He's just here trying to pump me about you.

01:16:09.830 --> 01:16:10.090
Here?

01:16:11.020 --> 01:16:13.750
And although I would have enjoyed a private showing,

01:16:13.930 --> 01:16:18.400
I couldn't go so far as to have you exposed on a coast-to-coast hook-up.

01:16:19.770 --> 01:16:22.730
Well, there's only one explanation I can give you.

01:16:23.450 --> 01:16:26.380
The fellow in love does a lot of things he wouldn't do if he were in his right mind.

01:16:30.120 --> 01:16:40.250
up joe we're on to five minutes you two can make love after the show how you doing well for the

01:16:40.250 --> 01:16:55.220
second time i'm right back to where i bumped into her taxi it's like a big night yeah for us

01:17:18.940 --> 01:17:23.460
Couldn't be better.

01:17:23.460 --> 01:17:25.030
I think he's following me.

01:17:35.950 --> 01:17:37.770
the stock from your ranch, Mr. Benning?

01:17:45.870 --> 01:17:58.660
Got something to take care of.

01:17:58.820 --> 01:18:00.000
Joan, you haven't got time.

01:18:00.190 --> 01:18:01.130
We'll be on again in a minute.

01:18:01.410 --> 01:18:02.070
I'll be back in time.

01:18:02.130 --> 01:18:02.670
This is important.

01:18:50.890 --> 01:18:52.690
I've decided to call the whole thing off.

01:18:52.690 --> 01:18:55.890
Oh, now, lady, you can't do that just when we're having fun.

01:18:55.890 --> 01:18:56.890
I'll pay you just the same.

01:18:56.890 --> 01:18:57.890
Sister, you don't have to pay.

01:18:57.890 --> 01:18:58.890
This one's on us.

01:18:58.890 --> 01:18:59.670
Sure.

01:19:01.560 --> 01:19:06.120
is going too far that's what he said when we asked him for the combination take care of him

01:19:09.730 --> 01:19:25.200
what was that sounds like joe take it easy fellas it's a fake hold up and i'm in on it

01:19:25.200 --> 01:19:30.000
i wouldn't try that again keep calm everybody there's nothing to be afraid of i'll handle this

01:19:30.000 --> 01:19:32.720
You folks stay right where you are. There may be shooting.

01:19:35.920 --> 01:19:37.120
Here I come, gal.

01:19:40.600 --> 01:19:43.460
But Benny rides again.

01:19:50.190 --> 01:19:53.130
I'll give Graham's pencil a real workout now.

01:19:53.290 --> 01:19:55.150
We'll see that he gets a ringside seat.

01:19:55.370 --> 01:19:57.690
Frame up or no frame up. Be careful with that gun.

01:19:57.810 --> 01:19:59.430
No worry, fellas got blanks in it.

01:20:07.360 --> 01:20:09.390
Now let's make this sound real.

01:20:09.390 --> 01:20:12.270
I thought it was you two rattlesnakes.

01:20:12.270 --> 01:20:14.870
Well, you went too far when you laid hands on my gal.

01:20:14.870 --> 01:20:17.120
And I'm gonna teach you a lesson.

01:20:17.120 --> 01:20:23.680
Well, fellas, keep it up.

01:20:38.640 --> 01:20:42.080
I'm sending them a lot of punishment.

01:20:42.080 --> 01:20:43.190
- Get to start.

01:21:01.560 --> 01:21:02.520
machine gun punch.

01:21:03.480 --> 01:21:12.770
They're overdoing it.

01:21:15.070 --> 01:21:18.940
Step closer and I'll drill you.

01:21:20.600 --> 01:21:29.760
You must have thrown one of them out the window.

01:22:00.160 --> 01:22:06.100
Joan. She's in there. Something must have gone

01:22:06.100 --> 01:22:18.370
wrong. Are you hurt? Jack's in there. They'll kill him.

01:22:30.000 --> 01:22:30.740
Oh, you were wonderful.

01:22:31.100 --> 01:22:32.040
Oh, it was nothing.

01:22:32.560 --> 01:22:34.180
Rochester, take care of what's left of me.

01:22:34.340 --> 01:22:34.880
I'm busy.

01:22:35.220 --> 01:22:35.520
Yes?

01:22:38.120 --> 01:22:39.040
Get him away from me!

01:22:40.120 --> 01:22:40.710
Take him!

01:23:02.140 --> 01:23:03.360
Everything's under control, boss.

01:23:05.280 --> 01:23:08.060
Uh, do you mind if I take a look at what's going on in there?

01:23:08.470 --> 01:23:10.050
Why no, bless your little heart.

01:23:15.500 --> 01:23:17.360
Goodbye, Mr. Chips.

01:23:32.010 --> 01:23:32.630
Thank you.
